Subject: [PATCH 10/11] Drop 0.6x ultra wide zoom shortcut

Sweet's capture zoom shortcuts include 0.6x, which switches to the
ultra wide camera. Violet has none, so selecting it crashes. Keep the
1x and 2x shortcuts.
---
 smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Sweet.smali | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Sweet.smali b/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Sweet.smali
index a3ce382..6b4323e 100644
--- a/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Sweet.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/mi/device/Sweet.smali
@@ -268,7 +268,7 @@
 .method public o000Ooo()Ljava/lang/String;
     .locals 0
 
-    const-string p0, "capture:0.6:1.0:2.0"
+    const-string p0, "capture:1.0:2.0"
 
     return-object p0
 .end method
